== Trivia ==
*'''Friendly Hiker''' is one of the [[NPC]]s the player must talk to during the quest [[Quests#Talk to the Villager Inhabitants|Talk to the Villager Inhabitants]].
*The other hiker that Friendly Hiker mentions is the {{NPCSprite|Hungry Hiker}}.
*The Friendly Hiker's name may be Jake. 
**It's unclear if the Jake mentioned in the [[Hungry Hiker]]'s dialogue refers to them or {{NPCSprite|Jake}}.

